# OPERATIONS §2.3 (M3): `check` does everything load does and evaluates nothing; a reality that loads, every ask's
# own checks passed, prints `ok` alone on the first line, and with no warning load decides, nothing else: exit 0.
# The base of L6_4_ask_alone_with_scenarios_all, its ask q_low left out.
=== options check exit=0
=== model.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "a model whose every item is read (invented)"

source card "a card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money PLN

def doubled: money PLN = amt + amt at reader

ask q: doubled law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
=== expect
ok
